["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>An over under is the easiest gun to show is empty: break it open and everyone can see. Two barrels, two chokes, two shots.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Parts of an over under like the Browning Citori: top lever, tang safety and barrel selector, receiver, hinge pin, two barrels, forearm and its latch, ejectors at the breech, a choke in each barrel.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Over under: the parts</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(10 100) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Top lever|Push it right to open the gun. Let it snap back when you close.\" data-tip-dot=\"120,115\"><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"115.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"120.0\" cy=\"115.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"69.0\" y=\"49.0\" width=\"82.0\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Top lever</text></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Safety, selector|Citori: slide back = safe (S shows). Sideways picks the barrel: O over, U under.\" data-tip-dot=\"104,120\"><line x1=\"104.0\" y1=\"184.0\" x2=\"104.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"104.0\" cy=\"120.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"1.3\" y=\"183.0\" width=\"137.4\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"70.0\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Safety, selector</text></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Hinge pin|The barrels pivot here. Keep it greased.\" data-tip-dot=\"162,137\"><line x1=\"162.0\" y1=\"220.0\" x2=\"162.0\" y2=\"137.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"162.0\" cy=\"137.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"131.2\" y=\"219.0\" width=\"77.7\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"236.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hinge pin</text></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Two barrels|Each has its own choke. Two shots, then reload.\" data-tip-dot=\"270,123\"><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"270.0\" y2=\"123.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"270.0\" cy=\"123.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"208.3\" y=\"49.0\" width=\"103.4\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Two barrels</text></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Forearm latch|Pull it out to take the forearm off.\" data-tip-dot=\"201,142\"><line x1=\"201.0\" y1=\"184.0\" x2=\"201.0\" y2=\"142.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"201.0\" cy=\"142.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"189.8\" y=\"183.0\" width=\"120.5\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"250.0\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Forearm latch</text></g>\n<g data-tip=\"Chokes|One in each muzzle. Learn the notches.\" data-tip-dot=\"382,126\"><line x1=\"382.0\" y1=\"220.0\" x2=\"382.0\" y2=\"126.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"382.0\" cy=\"126.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"317.6\" y=\"219.0\" width=\"64.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"236.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Chokes</text></g>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"266.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Two barrels, no magazine: no plug needed.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"292.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Browning Citori layout. Others are similar.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Steps follow the Browning Citori manual <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Your own gun's manual wins (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how it works</summary><ul><li>The top lever unlocks the action. The barrels pivot down on the hinge pin (95%, Citori manual).</li><li>One trigger fires both barrels in turn. The selector on the safety picks which fires first: O for over, U for under <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Ejectors throw out fired hulls when you open it and lift live shells for you to pull <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>No magazine, so no plug. Two shots is under the 3 shell bird limit (95%, my reading).</li><li>Many older over unders are not rated for steel (65%, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide/2\">Choosing your shotgun</a>). Check the maker's chart for yours.</li></ul></details>","<ul><li>Citori: slide the safety back, an S shows: safe <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Barrel selection only works with the safety on <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the manual's words</summary><ul><li>\"The complete action (both barrels) can be put on safe by drawing the thumb 'safety' rearward... an 'S' appears\" (95%, Citori manual).</li><li>\"Sliding the barrel selector to the left reveals an 'O' that indicates the top barrel (over) will fire first. Sliding the barrel selector to the right reveals a 'U'\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Tip: put the more open choke in the barrel that fires first: close birds come first (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"3\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Load an over under in 3 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 3</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under loading step 1: point it safe, slide the safety back so S shows, push the top lever to the right and let the barrels drop open.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Safety on, break it open</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><g transform=\"rotate(14 152 37)\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/></g><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<line x1=\"101.2\" y1=\"77.5\" x2=\"111.2\" y2=\"77.5\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M117.5 77.5 L109.4 81.4 L109.4 73.6Z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<line x1=\"87.5\" y1=\"244.0\" x2=\"87.5\" y2=\"95.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"87.5\" cy=\"95.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"49.7\" y=\"243.0\" width=\"120.6\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"260.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">safety back: S</text>\n<line x1=\"107.5\" y1=\"54.0\" x2=\"107.5\" y2=\"88.8\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"107.5\" cy=\"88.8\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"28.3\" y=\"31.0\" width=\"123.3\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"48.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">top lever right</text>\n<rect x=\"247.0\" y=\"203.0\" width=\"106.1\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"220.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">barrels drop</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Muzzles to the ground.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Point it safe. Safety on. Top lever right, open.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under loading step 2: look through both barrels, then put one shell in each chamber, or in the one you will fire first.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Look, then 2 shells in</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><g transform=\"rotate(14 152 37)\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/></g><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(137.5 45.5) scale(2.3)\"><g transform=\"translate(0.00 0.00) rotate(70)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.0\" width=\"21\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#3b6e8f\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.4\" width=\"4\" height=\"6.8\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"20.4\" y1=\"-2.0\" x2=\"20.4\" y2=\"2.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(163.5 45.5) scale(2.3)\"><g transform=\"translate(0.00 0.00) rotate(70)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.0\" width=\"21\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#3b6e8f\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.4\" width=\"4\" height=\"6.8\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"20.4\" y1=\"-2.0\" x2=\"20.4\" y2=\"2.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/></g></g><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"193.6\" y2=\"92.8\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M191.5 99.5 L190.0 89.6 L198.3 92.2Z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<rect x=\"219.0\" y=\"73.0\" width=\"162.1\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"90.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">one in each chamber</text>\n<rect x=\"229.8\" y=\"233.0\" width=\"140.4\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">bores clear first</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Right gauge, right length.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Look through both barrels. One shell in each.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under loading step 3: lift the stock up to the barrels, not the barrels to the stock, so the muzzles stay pointed down. The top lever snaps back. It is loaded. Safety stays on.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Close it: stock to barrels</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"168.4\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M60.0 160.0 L65.2 170.8 L54.8 170.8Z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"224.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"200.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"60.0\" cy=\"200.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"31.8\" y=\"223.0\" width=\"136.3\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"240.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lift the stock up</text>\n<rect x=\"223.3\" y=\"183.0\" width=\"153.4\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">muzzles stay down</text>\n<rect x=\"27.9\" y=\"42.0\" width=\"164.1\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LOADED: safety on</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Never swing the muzzles up to close.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Lift the stock to the barrels. Now loaded.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Close it by raising the stock, so the muzzles stay pointed down (Tip).</li><li>Load only when shooting is near: Browning's own rule <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the manual's words</summary><ol><li>\"Move the top lever to the right and open the breech.\"</li><li>\"Check the chambers and bores to be certain they are clear of obstructions.\"</li><li>\"Insert a shell in each chamber, or in the chamber you intend to fire, and close the breech.\"</li><li>\"NEVER LOAD A SHELL INTO THE CHAMBERS UNLESS SHOOTING IS IMMINENT\" (95%, Citori manual).</li><li>Let the top lever snap back by itself. Do not hold it back with your thumb <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ol></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"3\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Unload an over under in 3 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 3</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under unloading step 1: safety on, push the top lever right and open fully. Ejectors throw fired hulls out and lift live shells up. Tilt the gun so hulls fly clear of your face.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Open fully: hulls fly</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><g transform=\"rotate(14 152 37)\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/></g><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(157.5 70.0) scale(2.3)\"><g transform=\"translate(0.00 0.00) rotate(-50)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.0\" width=\"21\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#3b6e8f\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.4\" width=\"4\" height=\"6.8\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"20.4\" y1=\"-2.0\" x2=\"20.4\" y2=\"2.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/></g></g>\n<line x1=\"87.5\" y1=\"244.0\" x2=\"87.5\" y2=\"95.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"87.5\" cy=\"95.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"67.6\" y=\"243.0\" width=\"84.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"260.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">safety on</text>\n<rect x=\"232.0\" y=\"59.0\" width=\"136.0\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"76.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">fired hulls eject</text>\n<rect x=\"214.6\" y=\"213.0\" width=\"170.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"230.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">tilt it away from you</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Citori: live shells lift, you pull them.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Safety on. Open fully. Hulls fly, live shells lift.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under unloading step 2: pull any live shells out of the chambers by hand. Keep the muzzles pointed down.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Pull live shells by hand</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><g transform=\"rotate(14 152 37)\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/></g><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(137.5 45.5) scale(2.3)\"><g transform=\"translate(0.00 0.00) rotate(70)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.0\" width=\"21\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#3b6e8f\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-3.4\" width=\"4\" height=\"6.8\" fill=\"#c9a227\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"20.4\" y1=\"-2.0\" x2=\"20.4\" y2=\"2.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/></g></g><line x1=\"157.5\" y1=\"97.5\" x2=\"149.1\" y2=\"60.3\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M147.5 53.5 L153.7 61.3 L145.3 63.2Z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<rect x=\"231.8\" y=\"73.0\" width=\"136.3\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"90.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lift each one out</text>\n<rect x=\"242.6\" y=\"233.0\" width=\"114.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">muzzles down</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Count them: two in, two out.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Pull live shells out by hand. Count them.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Over under unloading step 3: look through both chambers and bores, then carry the gun broken open so everyone can see it is empty.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Look, then carry it open</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-30 70) scale(1.25)\"><path d=\"M0 16 L7 14 L92 22 L108 22 L108 38 L97 40 C88 42 81 46 75 53 L6 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M0 16 L5 15 L5 57 L0 57 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/><path d=\"M108 18 L150 18 L156 24 L156 40 L108 40 Z\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M100 18 L114 15 L116 18 Z\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"19\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><g transform=\"rotate(14 152 37)\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"19\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"27\" width=\"222\" height=\"7.5\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"26.7\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"26.7\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"18.4\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"18.4\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"366\" y=\"19\" width=\"12\" height=\"15.5\" fill=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"17.2\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M160 33 L240 33 L240 42 L168 42 C163 42 160 39 160 36 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"186\" y=\"40\" width=\"10\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/></g><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"37\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#3b4045\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><path d=\"M116 40 C116 53 138 53 140 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></g>\n\n<line x1=\"167.5\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"167.5\" y2=\"105.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"167.5\" cy=\"105.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"72.6\" y=\"43.0\" width=\"174.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">both chambers empty</text>\n<rect x=\"211.4\" y=\"212.0\" width=\"177.3\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"230.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">carry it broken open</text>\n<path d=\"M338 140 L347.3 149.8 L366 128.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">An open over under is the safest carry.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Look through both. Carry it open.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Tilt the gun so empty hulls fly away from your face <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>An open over under over your arm is the safest carry in a group (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the manual's words</summary><ul><li>\"Using your thumb, move the top lever fully to the right to open the action. The action must be opened completely to reset the firing mechanism\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>\"It may be necessary to pull downward slightly on the forearm to completely open the breech\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Cant the breech to the right (left for left handers) \"so empty hulls eject clear of your body and face\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>\"Fired shells will be thrown completely out of the gun upon opening the action; and unfired shells will be elevated above the chambers for unloading\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>\"Always inspect the chambers and barrels carefully after unloading\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Common over under problems: 1 second barrel does not fire because the trigger was not fully released, common with gloves. 2 action will not close because dirt is on the breech face. 3 the gun opens stiff when new. 4 hulls stick when left in the chambers.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Over under: what goes wrong</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"50\" width=\"376\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"75\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"80.4\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"71.0\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Second barrel will not fire</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"91.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Let the trigger fully forward first.</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"108\" width=\"376\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"133\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"138.4\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"129.0\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Action will not close</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"149.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unload. Clean the breech. No force.</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"166\" width=\"376\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"191\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"196.4\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"187.0\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Stiff to open</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"207.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Pull down a little on the forearm.</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"376\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"249\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"254.4\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hulls left in chambers</text>\n<text x=\"58.0\" y=\"265.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Take them out: they sweat moisture.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">From the Browning Citori manual.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Second barrel will not fire: let the trigger all the way forward <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Will not close: unload, clean the breech, never force it <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: fixes in full</summary><ul><li>Second shot fails: \"If the trigger is not permitted to return to its fully forward position, the firing mechanism will not reengage.\" Common with gloves and fast shooting (95%, Citori manual).</li><li>Debris on the breech can stop it closing: \"Open the gun and unload it. Carefully examine the action surfaces and remove any foreign matter\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Do not leave fired hulls in the chambers: moisture can \"sweat\" out of plastic hulls and cause rust <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>New guns are tight. Pull down a little on the forearm to open fully <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Broken open, everybody breathes easy. Carry it open between birds.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Swinging the barrels up to close the gun, sweeping your partner.</li><li>Holding the top lever so it does not lock fully.</li><li>Assuming any old over under is fine with steel shot.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>At a gun shop, open and close an over under 10 times with the stock coming up, muzzles down.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Browning Citori manual read directly <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.browning.com/content/dam/browning/support/owners-manuals/2021/21-BFA-299_Citori%20OM_WEB.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Browning Citori owner's manual (2021 web edition)</a>: safety, selector, top lever, loading, firing, unloading, cleaning. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li>Steel rating of older over unders: <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide\">Choosing your shotgun</a> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li></ul></details>"]